title: Defence Without a Blank Cheque
subtitle: [? if ministry_psl_in_cabinet = 1 or government_party = "psl": PSL expects continuity from inside cabinet.?][? if ministry_psl_in_cabinet = 0 and government_party != "psl": The Left owns the portfolio; opposition PSL can scrutinise it, not veto it.?]
