= Defence Without a Blank Cheque

The general staff wants procurement continuity and allies want predictable
commitments. [? if ministry_psl_in_cabinet = 1 or government_party = "psl": PSL
wants proof that losing the ministry did not change the state's strategic
line.?][? if ministry_psl_in_cabinet = 0 and government_party != "psl": PSL can
attack a change from opposition, but cannot stop the cabinet issuing one.?] The
Left can add democratic control without treating readiness as theatre.

- @procurement_oversight
- @eastern_readiness
- @readiness_review

@procurement_oversight
title: Fund readiness under independent procurement oversight
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. Couple equipment with scrutiny and maintenance.
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The readiness and oversight package requires one budget point.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; military_trust += 5; constitutional_restraint += 3; public_trust += 3; us_defence_channel += 2; psl_coalition_dissent += 3 if ministry_psl_in_cabinet = 1 or government_party = "psl"; news_headline = "Defence procurement receives independent costing and readiness tests"

Major contracts must publish life-cycle costs, domestic obligations and
readiness milestones. Commanders gain equipment they can maintain; accustomed
intermediaries discover that urgency is no longer a complete argument.

- #poland_card_finish


@eastern_readiness
title: Build a Ukraine readiness compact
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Join Polish defence readiness to sustained support for Ukraine.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Regional diplomacy and parliamentary coordination require one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; ukraine_solidarity += 6; eu_influence += 2; us_alliance_reliability += 2; border_security_confidence += 3; war_escalation_risk += 1; left_atlanticist_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "Poland proposes a readiness and Ukraine compact"

Logistics, air defence, munitions and reconstruction planning move into one
regional framework. The line is solidaristic and concrete, though some in the
party fear that every preparedness mechanism acquires a momentum of its own.

- #poland_card_finish


@readiness_review
title: Publish a civilian readiness review
subtitle: Free fallback. Doctrine, stockpiles and emergency powers tested in public — including by people who want them to fail.
on-arrival: military_trust += 2; border_security_confidence += 2; government_procedural_restraint += 3; public_trust += 2; public_mood_pending_national_security_salience += 3; far_right_agenda += 2; psl_coalition_dissent += 2 if ministry_psl_in_cabinet = 1 or government_party = "psl"; last_card_objection = 0; news_headline = "The Defence Ministry publishes a civilian review of readiness and emergency powers"

The review separates genuine gaps from procurement slogans and subjects
emergency plans to parliamentary standards. It does not buy a single vehicle;
it makes the next purchase harder to justify with secrecy alone.

- #poland_card_finish
